ishu-044-shenwenji-complete-ws1507959","paragraph_id":"c-nanqishu-044-shenwenji-complete:p005","quote":"　　昇明元年，沈攸之反，太祖加文季爲冠軍將軍，督吳興錢塘軍事。攸之先爲景和銜使殺慶之。至是文季收殺攸之弟新安太守登之，誅其宗族。加持節，進號征虜將軍，改封略陽縣侯，邑千戶。明年，遷丹陽尹，將軍如故。齊國初建，爲侍中，領祕書監。建元元年，轉太子右衞率，侍中如故。改封西豐縣侯，食邑千二百戶。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-nanqishu-044-shenwenji-complete:p005:m0007","object_person_mention_id":"c-nanqishu-044-shenwenji-complete:p005:m0056"}],"status":"source_attested","interpretation_note":"登之為沈攸之弟。","reviewer":"Codex（AI代理）","model":null,"human_reviewed":false}],"title_holdings":[{"id":"th-nanqishu-044-shenwenji-complete-5-52","title":"新安太守","kind":"office","mode":"attestation","person_id":"95b_le4_1ou","attestations":[{"id":"th-nanqishu-044-shenwenji-complete-5-52:a","paragraph_id":"c-nanqishu-044-shenwenji-complete:p005","start":52,"end":56,"surface":"新安太守","person_mention_id":"c-nanqishu-044-shenwenji-complete:p005:m0056","usage":"narrative","date_expression":null}],"effective_period":{"start":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]},"end":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]}},"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-nanqishu","book_id":"b-nanqishu-044","chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-044-shenwenji-complete","source_id":"s-nanqishu-044-shenwenji-complete-ws1507959","paragraph_id":"c-nanqishu-044-shenwenji-complete:p005","quote":"　　昇明元年，沈攸之反，太祖加文季爲冠軍將軍，督吳興錢塘軍事。攸之先爲景和銜使殺慶之。至是文季收殺攸之弟新安太守登之，誅其宗族。加持節，進號征虜將軍，改封略陽縣侯，邑千戶。明年，遷丹陽尹，將軍如故。齊國初建，爲侍中，領祕書監。建元元年，轉太子右衞率，侍中如故。改封西豐縣侯，食邑千二百戶。","person_mention_id":"c-nanqishu-044-shenwenji-complete:p005:m0056"}],"status":"source_attested","interpretation_note":"所見原官稱，未載全任期。","reviewer":"Codex（AI代理）","model":null,"human_reviewed":false}],"address_assertions":[],"table_occurrences":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"preferred_birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-nanqishu-044-shenwenji-complete:p005","text":"　　昇明元年，沈攸之反，太祖加文季爲冠軍將軍，督吳興錢塘軍事。攸之先爲景和銜使殺慶之。至是文季收殺攸之弟新安太守登之，誅其宗族。加持節，進號征虜將軍，